<section class="console" id="kifaru" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="demo-title">
  <header class="bar">
    <span class="wordmark"><span class="mark" aria-hidden="true">K</span> Kifaru <span class="divider">/</span> Workbench</span>
    <span class="tag">Interactive demo</span>
  </header>
  <div class="case">
    <p class="overline">Sample workspace <span>/</span> Task 014</p>
    <h2 id="demo-title">Sign-in audit review</h2>
    <p>Inspect a sample task, its finding, and the report draft.</p>
  </div>
  <fieldset class="switcher">
    <legend class="sr-only">Workbench view</legend>
    <label><input type="radio" name="demo-view" value="task" checked />Task</label>
    <label><input type="radio" name="demo-view" value="finding" />Finding</label>
    <label><input type="radio" name="demo-view" value="report" />Report</label>
  </fieldset>

  <div class="surface">
    <section class="pane task" aria-label="Task conversation">
      <p class="overline">Task conversation</p>
      <div class="prompt">
        <strong>Operator</strong>
        <p>Our staging policy calls for 30 days of sign-in history. Does the configuration match?</p>
      </div>
      <div class="reply">
        <strong>Kifaru</strong>
        <p>The saved policy says 30 days. The staging configuration says 14.
          I’ve attached both records to the finding for review.</p>
      </div>
      <details>
        <summary>Activity <span>2 records compared</span></summary>
        <ul><li>Read the staging retention policy.</li><li>Compared it with the saved configuration snapshot.</li></ul>
      </details>
    </section>

    <section class="pane finding" aria-label="Finding and evidence">
      <p class="overline">Finding 01 <span>/</span> Needs review</p>
      <h3>Sign-in retention falls short of policy</h3>
      <p>The settings differ by 16 days. The snapshot alone does not show whether older records still exist.</p>
      <details open>
        <summary>Evidence <span>2 attachments</span></summary>
        <dl>
          <div><dt>Retention policy</dt><dd>30 days required</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Staging configuration</dt><dd>14 days configured</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </details>
    </section>

    <section class="pane report" aria-label="Report draft">
      <p class="overline">Report draft <span>/</span> Version 1</p>
      <h3>Staging sign-in review</h3>
      <p>The configuration doesn’t meet the retention policy. We haven’t verified the age of the oldest stored event.</p>
      <div class="handoff">
        <strong>Reviewer handoff</strong>
        <p>Ask the staging owner to confirm how long events are kept. Recheck the setting after the owner updates it.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
  <footer class="foot">Sample data only. This demo does not run tools or scan a target.</footer>
</section>

